{"id":8574,"date":"2022-12-05T07:21:39","date_gmt":"2022-12-05T12:21:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=8574"},"modified":"2022-12-05T08:52:15","modified_gmt":"2022-12-05T13:52:15","slug":"going-under-the-knife-and-robot","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2022\/12\/05\/going-under-the-knife-and-robot\/","title":{"rendered":"Going under the knife (and robot)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>It&#8217;s 6:30am, actually a sleep-in day for me because when I&#8217;m working (driving) for the county I&#8217;m up at 4am.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We assumed surgery would be scheduled early just like in the past for my rotator cuff surgery and the left hip, but when they called Friday they told me to arrive at 11am.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>So here I sit.. no breakfast.. no coffee.. in fact nothing by mouth since 6pm last night per their instructions.  It&#8217;ll be 20 hours or so by the time I&#8217;m out of surgery and in post-op.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>That&#8217;s ok, although my stomach will be grumbling and my mouth will be like sandpaper &#8230; I&#8217;ll eventually have a good hip with great rotation and no pain to look forward to.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I&#8217;m ready to get this over.  I&#8217;ve got my cane, I&#8217;ve got my walker, I&#8217;ve even got the elevated toilet seat with grab bars to help me as I recuperate.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Just last week we had the old cast iron porcelain painted bathtub pulled out and replaced with a nice new walk-in shower.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/img_20221201_0953483316278295661449067619.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8578\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/img_20221201_0953483316278295661449067619.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/img_20221201_0953483316278295661449067619-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/img_20221201_0953483316278295661449067619-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">During installation of the walk-in shower<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>In the title of this post I mentioned the robot.  If you&#8217;re curious how this works, take a look at the video below.  It&#8217;s really fascinating how this thing works along with the doctor.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"THA- Stryker Mako Total Hip Animation\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/dxlK7NK_3Ps?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>That&#8217;s all for now &#8230; more later<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>It&#8217;s 6:30am, actually a sleep-in day for me because when I&#8217;m working (driving) for the county I&#8217;m up at 4am. We assumed surgery would be scheduled early just like in the past for my rotator cuff surgery and the left hip, but when they called Friday they told me to arrive at 11am. So here &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2022\/12\/05\/going-under-the-knife-and-robot\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Going under the knife (and robot)<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[554708145,554708150,554707999,554707823],"tags":[554707660,554707956,554708153,554708154,554708151,554707939,554708152],"class_list":["post-8574","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-health","category-medical","category-repair","category-technology","tag-herbsells","tag-hip","tag-rehab","tag-replacement","tag-robot","tag-surgery","tag-therapy"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8574","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8574"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8574\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":8585,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8574\/revisions\/8585"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8574"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=8574"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=8574"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}